---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Validating Supplier Rate Cards Against Contractual Terms - Marker">
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-24">
      <a href="/case-studies" class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">
        <svg class="mr-1 h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
        </svg>
        All Case Studies
      </a>

      <span class="mb-3 inline-block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Premium Menswear</span>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Validating Supplier Rate Cards Against Contractual Terms</h1>

      <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/50 p-5 text-sm">
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div>
            <span class="block font-medium text-foreground">Company</span>
            <span class="text-muted-foreground">Premium menswear brand operating at ~70% gross margins with long-tenured vendor relationships</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-medium text-foreground">Team</span>
            <span class="text-muted-foreground">VP of Product Development managing costing negotiations and supplier compliance</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-medium text-foreground">Key Challenge</span>
            <span class="text-muted-foreground">No automated way to verify whether supplier quotes and invoices adhered to agreed rate cards and contractual terms</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The VP of Product Development at this premium menswear brand managed a network of long-tenured suppliers — vendors with 10-year relationships built on trust and consistency. But even in trusted relationships, rate cards evolve and terms can drift. The team had no automated way to verify that a supplier's quote on a new style adhered to the agreed rate card, or that an invoice reflected the negotiated terms.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The brand operates at approximately 70% gross margins, so the issue wasn't existential — but it was cumulative. Over hundreds of POs per season, small deviations from agreed rates add up. And without a system that flagged discrepancies in real time, the team only caught issues during manual reviews that happened weeks or months later, long after the opportunity to address them had passed.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The VP's guiding question for every product was simple: "Is the cost reasonable?" But answering that question required comparing the current quote against the rate card, historical pricing for similar constructions, and the negotiated MOQ/MCQ tiers — a manual process that consumed time the team didn't have.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">The Approach</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Marker ingests the brand's supplier rate cards and contractual terms, then validates every incoming quote and invoice against them in real time. When a supplier sends a cost sheet via email, Marker compares each line item against the agreed rate card, flagging any deviations — whether it's a unit price that exceeds the negotiated tier, a surcharge that wasn't in the original terms, or a quantity that doesn't meet the MOQ threshold for the quoted price.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Validation happens before the team responds, so discrepancies can be addressed in the same communication cycle rather than discovered weeks later. For a brand with strong vendor relationships, this isn't about catching bad actors — it's about ensuring accuracy across hundreds of transactions where honest errors are inevitable. The team trusts their suppliers; Marker verifies the math.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Key Takeaways</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1.5 block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            <span>Every incoming quote and invoice validated against agreed rate cards and contractual terms in real time</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1.5 block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            <span>MOQ/MCQ tier pricing verified automatically — ensuring quoted prices match the committed quantity bracket</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1.5 block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            <span>Discrepancies flagged before the team responds, enabling correction in the same communication cycle</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1.5 block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
            <span>Preserves trust-based vendor relationships while ensuring accuracy across high transaction volumes</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-12 rounded-lg border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">See how Marker validates supplier pricing against your contractual terms.</p>
        <a href="/book-demo" class="mt-4 inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Book a Demo</a>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
